      <title>Campus-Wide Walking Challenge at Blackburn Center (Armour J. Blackburn University Center)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53684226218179/huge/4a3eac54584e40d2c088b64204cfc1f235443359.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 17 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Walking lowers the risk of heart disease, helps manage weight, and strengthens muscles. It also reduces stress, clears the mind, and improves daily mood. </p>

<p> </p>

<p>All staff and faculty are invited to join in a campus-wide walking challenge from August 17-September 20. Participants will enroll, set goals, and track daily steps.   </p>

<p> </p>

<p>To support the challenge, an in-person launch will be held on Monday, August 17, in front of Blackburn Hall. Led by Howard University Wellness Champion Alisha McDougal, and supported by the HR Wellness and Benefits team, participants will gather and walk together in a shady area around campus. This in-person group walk will be repeated every Monday during the challenge.  Please bring your walking shoes and water.   </p>

<p> </p>

<p>For more information, contact Alisha McDougal at <a href="mailto:Alisha.McDougal@Howard.edu">Alisha.McDougal@Howard.edu</a> or Onsite Health Coach Katherine Smith at <a href="mailto:Katherine.Smith@Evernorth.com">Katherine.Smith@Evernorth.com</a>.</p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/campus-wide-walking-challenge">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A Campus-Wide Walking Challenge&amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Aug 17%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0AWalking lowers the risk of heart disease%2C helps manage weight%2C and strengthens muscles. It also reduces stress%2C clears the mind%2C and improves daily mood. %0A%0A %0A%0AAll staff and faculty are invited to join in a campus-wide walking challenge from August 17-September 20. Participants will enroll%2C set goals%2C and track daily steps.   %0A%0A %0A%0ATo support the challenge%2C an in-person launch will be held on Monday%2C August 17%2C in front of Blackburn Hall. Led by Howard University Wellness Champion Alisha McDougal%2C and supported by the HR Wellness and Benefits team%2C participants will gather and walk together in a shady area around campus. This in-person group walk will be repeated every Monday during the challenge.  Please bring your walking shoes and water.   %0A%0A %0A%0AFor more information%2C contact Alisha McDougal at Alisha.McDougal%40Howard.edu or Onsite Health Coach Katherine Smith at Katherine.Smith%40Evernorth.com.%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fevents.howard.edu%2Fevent%2Fcampus-wide-walking-challenge%0A">Email this event</a></p></div></div>]]></description>
